1.
If we're talking about the CollageTextView, it doesn't need any other file as it is used in the
controller to send information to the user. It just needs the CollageView and CollageTextView file.

For the GUIView, it needs the Features interface so that there is functionality inside the GUI when
the user interacts with the GUI. The files that it needs are the GUIView, JFrameView, and
Features file.

2.
For the CollageTextView, the CollageView is the class implementing the CollageTextView so as the
class implementing the interface it needs it and it needs itself in order to exist.

For the JFrameView, it needs the Features interface so that it has functionality to respond to user
input as it is an asynchronous system. It needs the interface that it implements which is the
GUIView and it needs the JFrameView, it needs itself to exist.